"en": "Um... if possible...\na tonkatsu bento please...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27318,
"en": "What's up with this guy?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27319,
"en": "Well I can't just leave him... Fine, I\nguess I'll get him a tonkatsu bento.",
