"en": "Ngh... someone please...\nbring me a tonkatsu bento...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27321,
"en": "He seems to be hungry.\nI guess I'll get him a tonkatsu bento.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27322,
"en": "Here, it's a tonkatsu bento\nlike you asked for.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27323,
"en": "O-Ooooooh...!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27324,
"en": "Well gosh, you're a lifesaver... My crisis\nmanagement assessment must still need work.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27325,
"en": "Regardless, you're kind enough to help\nout a stranger... That deserves respect.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27326,
"en": "What's your name?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27327,
"en": "Kiryu-kun, huh? I'm Saigo,\nCrisis Management Professional.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27328,
"en": "Crisis Management... Professional?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27329,
"en": "Yes. Let me ask you, what do you think is the\nnumber one threat to modern day Japan?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27330,
"en": "A threat to Japan?\nHmm, I don't know. What is it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27331,
"en": "Peace senility. People in Japan today\nare sitting complacent atop peace.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27332,
"en": "I fought as a mercenary in the Middle East\nand witnessed countless deaths.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27333,
"en": "From my perspective, people in Japan these\ndays have a total lack of crisis awareness!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27334,
"en": "I-I see...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27335,
"en": "That's why I've taken the initiative to teach\nthe careless masses about crisis management.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27336,
"en": "So... why was a Crisis Management\nProfessional lying on the ground?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27337,
"en": "To put it simply, I'm broke.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27338,
"en": "Thing is, I'm trying to complete the ultimate\nself-defense technique in case of a huge crisis.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27339,
"en": "The ultimate self-defense technique...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27340,
"en": "Mhm, I've traveled the world learning fighting\nstyles to craft the ultimate technique...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27341,
"en": "But my finances reached rock bottom before\nI could finish, so I came back in tears.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27342,
"en": "If you're a Crisis Management Professional,\nyou should've planned a little better...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27343,
"en": "Since my training was cut short, I still\nneed to complete this technique somehow.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27344,
"en": "Obviously I don't have money to travel again.\nI'm honestly unsure where I go from here.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27345,
"en": "Hm... It's just a thought, but if you can't\ngo overseas, then maybe finish it here?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27346,
"en": "Finish it nearby, eh...? Brilliant,\nKiryu-kun. You're exactly right...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27347,
"en": "Since I'm broke, I need to find someone in\nOnomichi to help me finish this technique.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27348,
"en": "I wonder if you can even find\nsomeone like that in Onomichi.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27349,
"en": "Mmm, are you suuure...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27350,
"en": "Mmm...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27351,
"en": "Earth to Kiryu-kun, are you listening...?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27352,
"en": "Don't you realize I'm not gonna do it?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27353,
"en": "Now, don't be so wishy-washy.\nAren't you worried about Japan's future?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
