"en": "Didn't I say earlier? The people of today's\nJapan lack any sort of crisis awareness!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27362,
"en": "You're crazy strong, Kiryu-kun...!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27363,
"en": "I've traveled all over the world,\nbut I've never had an opponent like you.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27364,
"en": "I might've...\nfound myself the ultimate partner...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27365,
"en": "Partner? Don't tell me... you think I'm\ngoing to stick around to help you?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27366,
"en": "You're a smart guy, Kiryu-kun.\nThat's exactly what I'm doing.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27367,
"en": "I feel like fighting you will help me\ntrain in the areas I'm lacking.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27368,
"en": "I'd like for you to continue fighting me\nso I can complete my ultimate technique.",
