"max": null
},
{
"id": 27370,
"en": "If anything, I might start stalking\nyou until you cooperate!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27371,
"en": "Is that really what you want?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27372,
"en": "I would not want that...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27373,
"en": "God damn it...\nFine, I'll help you out when I'm free.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27374,
"en": "I like that attitude! You're making a\nbright future for crisis management.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27375,
"en": "Well, that's all for today.\nLet's have a fight again soon.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
