"en": "All right then, farewell...!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27377,
"en": "I got dragged into another weird mess...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27378,
"en": "He claims he's a crisis management pro...\nso maybe I'll learn something from him.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27379,
"en": "Whoa! I stepped on dog poop!",
