"en": "Can we spar a bit? I came up with a great\nself-defense technique I'd like to try.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27382,
"en": "Can we spar a bit? I came up with an even\nbetter self-defense technique I'd like to try.",
