"en": "The ultimate self-defense technique I've been\ndeveloping through our fights is complete.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27404,
"en": "Oh, that's good to hear.",
