"max": null
},
{
"id": 27413,
"en": "You should always be at full power.\nThat's how crisis management works, okay?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27414,
"en": "(So humiliating... but he's strong... I can't\nfight him until I'm in perfect condition.)",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27415,
"en": "There you are, Kiryu-kun.\nAre you in perfect condition this time?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27416,
"en": "Yeah, I'm fine.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27417,
"en": "Then let's fight. Fall prey to my\nultimate self-defense technique.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27418,
"en": "Here I coooooome! Kiryuuuuuu!",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27419,
"en": "I lost, Kiryu-kun.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27420,
"en": "I thought I completed the ultimate technique...\nbut I guess it's not ultimate quite yet.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27421,
"en": "It was pretty darn powerful though.\nI'd say it's strong enough already.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27422,
"en": "No... there's no \"strong enough\" in crisis\nmanagement. Nothing is ever truly safe.",
