"max": null
},
{
"id": 27423,
"en": "But, even though 100% safety is impossible,\nI have to try to get as close to it as I can.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_b26|#",
"max": null
},
{
