{
"id": 27540,
"en": "Isn't it time you came over to my side?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27541,
"en": "...What are you saying?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27542,
"en": "I'm building a clan these days, and we'd\nbe unstoppable with you among our ranks.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27543,
"en": "Fool...! You think I am brought\nso low as to ally with you!?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27544,
"en": "You'll have the opportunity to fight every day.\nDon't you want to get stronger? It's perfect.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27545,
"en": "And if your aim is to take me out, wouldn't\nbeing closer to me make it easier to do?",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27546,
"en": "Lend me your strength, Amon.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27547,
"en": "In exchange, you can ambush me whenever you feel\nthe need. Not that I'm going to let you win.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27548,
"en": "Fine then. Just know, it will eventually\nbecome apparent how foolish this decision is.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27549,
"en": "We're done here, then.\nWelcome aboard, Amon.",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27550,
"en": "Do not assume you can ever\ntame the Amon Clan...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_sub_a99|#",
"max": null
},
{
"id": 27551,
"en": "It's locked...",
"ctx": "sound_auth|table/#//# + sound_auth_subtitles_speech_list_adv_player_cmn|#",
"max": null
},
{
